---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Terms of Use | Suncoast Home Check';
const description =
  'The terms that govern your use of the Suncoast Home Check website and the scope of our Tampa Bay home-watch services.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical="/terms/">
  <section class="page-hero" style="height:clamp(240px,32vh,320px)">
    <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" alt="Tampa Bay Gulf coast at golden hour" />
    <div class="scrim"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="prose">
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 2026</p>

    <p>These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of the Suncoast Home Check website. By using this site you agree to these terms. Home-watch services are provided under a separate service agreement between Suncoast Home Check and each client, which controls in the event of any conflict.</p>

    <h2>About our service</h2>
    <p>Suncoast Home Check provides recurring, scheduled visual inspections (&ldquo;home watch&rdquo;) of homes, townhomes, and condos in Tampa Bay and the Gulf Coast, with a dated photo report after each visit. Home watch is a visual check for signs of problems — it is not a guarantee against loss, and it is not a security, alarm-monitoring, cleaning, repair, or property-management service. We are not home inspectors, contractors, or insurance advisors.</p>

    <h2>No guarantee of prevention</h2>
    <p>We take care to identify and report visible issues during our visits, but conditions can change between scheduled visits, and some problems are not visible on inspection. We are not liable for loss or damage that occurs between visits or that could not reasonably be detected during a routine visual check.</p>

    <h2>Website content</h2>
    <p>Content on this site, including plan descriptions and pricing, is provided for general information and may change without notice. Any pricing shown is sample pricing; final plans and fees are confirmed in your service agreement after a review of your home and needs.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The text, images, and design of this website are the property of Suncoast Home Check or its licensors and may not be copied or reused without permission.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Suncoast Home Check is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this website. Nothing in these terms limits any rights you have under your separate service agreement or applicable law.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Contact Bryan Alan Manly at <a href="mailto:bryan.manly@compass.com">bryan.manly@compass.com</a> or <a href="tel:17276412419">727-641-2419</a>, Tampa Bay, Florida.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="inline-cta">
    <h2>Questions about home watch?</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact/">Get a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</Base>
